{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e1c319237a95b5a1955de058c70a3b8d321ee4b8719db60c25c3d8a60f0aeff1", "ja": "（今日はドラマ撮影のリハーサル。亜利沙と律子が\nおもちゃ屋の人形を演じるドタバタコメディだ）", "zh": "（今天是电视剧拍摄的彩排。这是一部由亚利沙和律子\n饰演玩具店人偶的热闹喜剧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "a39e4573fb53cdf6da5de52925ca2cfac0017701ae7c8e3f4dff13bd97eea07a", "ja": "ちょっと亜利沙。あなた、私の演技ばっかり見てて\n自分のセリフ飛ばしたでしょ。まったくもう……。", "zh": "喂，亚利沙。你光顾着看我的表演，把自己的台词都忘了吧。真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c6560c71820f341af15559a14029aa9a452334072bd0c4c6279f5706c9b935e1", "ja": "うっ……でも、泣き虫な律子センパイなんて、\n激レア中の激レアですから、仕方ないじゃないですか！", "zh": "呜……可是，爱哭鬼律子前辈，\n可是超罕见中的超罕见啊，这也是没办法的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fe7f183fef0d421f84062f022c3a4c9ec15e2bd9cdbcb0618d003ab5a3bffaab", "ja": "まあまあ、亜利沙、レアな律子の姿はオンエアで\nたっぷり見られるだろう？　今は仕事に集中しよう。", "zh": "好了好了，亚利沙，律子难得一见的样子，播出时肯定能看个够吧？现在还是专心工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "a4915b932bba5d2e98ee399b472dfbdb2a475b2ab5e0ba859f868ba1cb32876d", "ja": "それに亜利沙だって、弱気な私をどついて発破をかける\n強気系キャラじゃない。こっちも激レアだと思うわよ？", "zh": "而且，亚利沙也不是那种会对泄气的我动手、给我打气的强势系角色。这种场面也超级罕见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "e4d21a0a27df42430021fd518517523bf66e85fd4c6427b9d3588c3d5ef6f5be", "ja": "いやあ、それなんですが……。やっぱりありさが\n律子センパイを叱るのは解釈違いといいますか……。", "zh": "哎呀，关于这个嘛……果然要说亚利沙训斥律子前辈，感觉还是和我的理解不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "41948819a79f820bc3383d1d90857db344bfa816a0d1aae017513b3e78a5d2a8", "ja": "いつもは律子センパイが引っ張ってくれるので。\n逆になると、なんだか変な気分でして……。", "zh": "平时都是律子前辈带着我走的。\n一旦反过来，总觉得怪怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2f6526e036a7025f0d8a046ae3af3be4d37bd5a918cdd66839b526967f185b65", "ja": "まさかセリフが飛んだのは、それも一因か？\nまあ、確かにいつもと立場は逆かもだけど……。", "zh": "难不成忘词也是因为这个原因？\n不过，现在的立场的确保跟平时相反就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "5a113d23a4d0658f21cb7d2ac3c9e0f88fd1aac3295890d70f9fbf794f3d0e34", "ja": "違和感があるのはわかるけど、大事なお仕事よ。\nきっぱり割りきって、堂々と演じないとね？", "zh": "我知道你觉得不太对劲，但这是很重要的工作。要果断把这些想法放到一边，堂堂正正地演才行，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1009_p", "source_sha256": "be6e0d408b73119c083de24d08917e5a7acd851239ba4b97f4ccb00e7704e357", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。それにな、亜利沙……ここだけの話。\n律子も結構、悩んだりくじけたりしてるんだ。", "zh": "啊，是的。而且，亚利沙……这话只在这里说。律子其实也经常烦恼、受挫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "6a8b92451e3f7c45448fa22faeef923b40775390fa5356c5608d7c55875f9f1d", "ja": "ちょっ、{$P$}！？\n今、そんなこと、亜利沙に言わなくても……っ！", "zh": "等、{$P$}！？\n现在这种事，没必要告诉亚利沙吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eb0602a82ddebae32f81956cfc8c77af8c22743034c07fcfc71129ba53270cda", "ja": "自分はアイドルに向いてない、って悩んだりして……。\n弱気な律子は、俺から見たらそうレアでもないんだ。", "zh": "你还会烦恼自己不适合当偶像什么的……\n在我看来，没自信的律子可不算少见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "932707cdb7ba581083912e31fc57834a7748e6f94705bc53b74b7c034e292f38", "ja": "そ、それくらい、別に普通の悩みじゃないですか！\n亜利沙も、あんまり真に受けないように……！", "zh": "那、那种程度的烦恼，不是很普通吗！\n亜利沙，你也别太当真了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "cb2de27055dd4f13e5570ec142e9257ab9907da5e0b383c1d0f73e9fd912c803", "ja": "……ないですよ。\n……たい……そんなこと……ないです……。", "zh": "……没有哦。\n……想要……那种事……才没有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1014_p", "source_sha256": "82784b916b56272738ab8fb9c5d0aad3dcadb6991ac6fff10df87c5ed5f3697c", "ja": "ええと、亜利沙……？", "zh": "那个，亚利沙……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed420e10847030192a35cd3806d80b274347113b861155ba8a9c259e70e636c6", "ja": "律子センパイがアイドルに向いてない～っ！？\nどーこのすっとこどっこいが言ったんですかぁ！？", "zh": "律子前辈不适合当偶像～！？\n是哪个不长眼的糊涂蛋说的啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "7267e3eecaba4afe793d149ad07991dd7e59e2837de585e0201707b965f5971a", "ja": "ありさが証明してみせます！　『アイドル・秋月律子が\n輝いた瞬間ベスト10』を！　まずはこの写真を……。", "zh": "就由亚利沙来证明给你们看！用《偶像·秋月律子\n最为闪耀的瞬间Best10》！首先看这张照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "66e392f0a0af210b8d5accc91fb43771ec113d061c8b008e0aeaf18e59449f6e", "ja": "！！　お……落ち着け、亜利沙！", "zh": "！！冷、冷静点，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "7a6669695ed6e5e677220f598cae5dc10ee26b481d5aa88b05f6b16d0716d3f8", "ja": "言われたわけじゃなく、ただ私が悩んでただけで……！\nていうか亜利沙、コレまた許可なく撮ったわね！？", "zh": "又没人让我烦恼，只是我自己想太多而已……！还有，亚利沙，你又没经过许可就拍了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "38d1476e820d7adea1e205a2e73ca601a9dea67385079c1d20c213470aa19aeb", "ja": "くっ……10枚じゃ、律子センパイの魅力を伝えきれ\nない。こうなったら、このお仕事で知らしめないと！", "zh": "唔……光是10张，根本无法传达律子前辈的魅力。既然如此，就得通过这份工作让大家知道才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "680ede1759dfb3e73b57b424cd903c5fb15c2d95418f7fea481554641dcf13e7", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと亜利沙、やる気出したのはいいけど変な\nこと言い回らないで……って、ねえ、聞いてるー！？", "zh": "等、等一下，亚利沙，你有干劲是好事，但别到处乱说些奇怪的话……喂，你听到了吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0564_1021_p", "source_sha256": "36b842d3db9fd9642eeafbc19038d2147afc21404b121dc48e7ee4205585bc71", "ja": "（アイドルが関われば、亜利沙は律子もリードできる。\n普段と違う関係性で、より魅力的な作品になるはずだ）", "zh": "（只要有偶像参与，亚利沙甚至能带领律子。以这种不同于平时的关系，一定能创作出更具魅力的作品。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
